---
title: Chemex by James Hoffmann
source: https://honestcoffeeguide.com/brew-recipes/james-hoffmann-chemex-recipe/
filter: paper
---

@Chemex 30g 500g 100°C
grind medium

/rinse
0:00 80g ~10s bloom spiral -- gentle circles, saturate all the coffee
0:45 300g ~30s spiral
1:15 500g ~30s spiral
1:45 /stir -- gently, once clockwise then once counter-clockwise
1:55 /swirl ~3s -- shake the brewer gently
1:58 /drawdown

target 4:10 -- remove the filter and swirl the coffee before serving
